لسيرفر، سيرفرات سواء الـ ChatGPT أو Gemini، كل ده في فايل واحد بحيث إن أنا أعمل run مثلاً أو install للكذا يثبت لي الـ library، يثبت لي، يثبت لي، بالذات في الآخر يعني هبقى أحكيهولك في الآخر يعني، اللي هو يعني إيه في الآخر إحنا في الـ development، فأنا عايز\n<truncated 8143 bytes>\n\n<summary>\n# Continuation Summary — Pharmacy PDF Vision Extraction Architecture & Pipeline Migration\n\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Core Goal**: Fully transition the pharmacy catalog extraction layer from error-prone OCR (`unstructured.io`) to Google Gemini Vision page-by-page extraction, ensuring pristine Arabic drug names (`item_name_raw`) with zero spelling corruption or dropped items.\n- **Milestone Achieved**: End-to-end manual verification passed with 100% real drug names extracted from Page 1 of `المكرومي المنصورة.pdf` via the dedicated local vision gateway (`MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision`).\n- **User's Architectural Directives**:\n  1. **Strict Code Preservation**: Clone `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy` to `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision`. The original `Pharmacy-agy` remains 100% untouched as a safe rollback fallback.\n  2. **Multi-Format Ingestion**:\n     - **Excel (`.xlsx`)**: Auto-detect drug name column across sheets.\n     - **Markdown (`.md`)**: Structured tabular/list parser.\n     - **PDF**: Pure Vision pipeline via `pypdfium2` (Scale 2.5, WebP ~299 KB per page).\n  3. **Organized Project/Process Folder Structure**: Dedicated subdirectories per process for `pdfs/`, `images/`, `caches/`, and `output/`. No scattered temp files.\n  4. **Strict Isolation & Safe Execution**: Send exactly **one page image per request** in a fresh chat session.\n  5. **Metadata Deduplication & Resume**: Check file metadata/hashes before extraction. If cached responses exist, reuse them; if a run halted mid-way, resume unprocessed pages.\n  6. **Matching Layer Adaptation**: Update the matching input adapter to consume the new clean Vision schema: `{\"items\": [{\"item_name_raw\": \"...\", \"source_page\": N}]}`.\n  7. **Documentation & Graphs**: Update system architecture specifications, workflow diagrams, and specs to reflect the new pipeline.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed:\n1. **Vision Gateway Fork**:\n   - Cloned `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio` $\\rightarrow$ `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision`.\n   - Updated `MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision\\app.py`:\n     - Added multipart message parsing for Base64 WebP images (`extract_prompt_and_images`).\n     - Added Playwright DOM file attachment via `input[type=\"file\"], [data-test-upload-file-input]`.\n     - Implemented the **Run Button Active Hook**: waits up to 25s for Google AI Studio's token calculation to complete (`aria-disabled=\"false\"`) before clicking the Run button.\n     - Verified live test: Request succeeded in 60.7s, returning exact ground-truth drugs (`ايراستابكس`, `ايرالونير`, `ايروكسول`, `ايزابريل`).\n2. **Pristine Baseline Protection**:\n   - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio` is untouched.\n   - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy` is untouched.\n3. **Artifacts Produced**:\n   - `scratch/test_endpoint_vision.py`: Standalone client test script.\n   - `scratch/inspect_run_button_states.py`: Confirmed transition from `aria-disabled=\"true\"` to `aria-disabled=\"false\"` upon tokenization.\n   - `scratch/test_ai_studio_full_run.py`: Proved automated submission and thinking/generation.\n   - `scratch/verify_generation_started.png`: Visual proof of attached image, prompt, and active model generation.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings & Design Decisions\n1. **Google AI Studio Tokenizer Delay**:\n   - When an image is attached, Google AI Studio tokenizes it asynchronously (~1.5s–6.0s).\n   - During tokenization, `aria-disabled=\"true\"` on `button.ctrl-enter`; firing shortcuts like `Control+Enter` is silently ignored.\n   - Solution: Polling `aria-disabled == \"false\"` followed by a direct `.click()` guarantees 100% execution reliability.\n2. **Vision Extraction Schema**:\n   - Native Vision JSON schema: `{\"items\": [{\"item_name_raw\": str, \"source_page\": int}]}`.\n   - Eliminates all Unstructured.io dependencies, Persian letter corruption (`ک`, `پ`), dropped characters (`فتال` vs `فنتال`), and altered drug identities.\n3. **Single-Page Turn vs Multi-Page Context**:\n   - Sending one page per request prevents cumulative context bloat, column confusion, and hallucinated items across invoice pages.\n4. **Environment**:\n   - Active Conda Python: `D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe`.\n   - Always run commands with safe Cwd (`Pharmacy-agy` or `Pharmacy-agy-vision`), avoiding `D:\\AI_Engineer` to prevent path resolution conflicts with `powershell.cmd`.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Active Context\n- **Conda Environment**: `D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv`\n- **Vision Server**: `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision` (configured for port `8001`, `HEADLESS=false`).\n- **Target Copy Path for Pharmacy**: `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision` (to be created from `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy`).\n- **Test Warehouse PDF**: `data\\processes\\PROC-015\\input_warehouses\\المكرومي المنصورة.pdf` (4 pages).\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps (Priority Order)\n1. **Create Branch Copy of Pharmacy-agy**:\n   - Copy `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy` to `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision` using robocopy/PowerShell (excluding `__pycache__`, `.git`, large temporary files).\n2. **Review & Expand Pipeline Architecture Plan with User**:\n   - Structure per-process directory layout:\n     ```\n     data/processes/PROC-XXX/\n       ├── input_shortages/\n       ├── input_warehouses/\n       │     └── images/        # WebP renders of PDF pages (page_1.webp, page_2.webp)\n       ├── cache/\n       │     └── vision_extractions/ # Per-page JSON responses + file_meta.json\n       └── output/\n     ```\n   - Design metadata hashing (`hashlib.sha256` of file content + file size + modification time) for caching and resume capability.\n   - Address `.md` and `.xlsx` ingestion handlers cleanly.\n3. **Impleme